# Phase 11 / Task 2: `scripts/deploy.env` carries a real Supabase service_role
# key + JWT secret. `.env.*` does NOT match `deploy.env`, so without this line
# those credentials are COPYed into an image layer. Worse, because
# src/storage/database/supabase-client.ts loads it with dotenv `override: true`,
# a baked copy would silently win over the container's injected environment —
# so key rotation would require an image rebuild, not a restart.
.env
.env.*
scripts/deploy.env
scripts/*.env
*.env
!.env.example
